\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Eternal Sun of Righteousness,
\par Display Thy beams divine,
\par And cause the glories of Thy face
\par Upon my heart to shine.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Light in Thy light O may I see,
\par Thy grace and mercy prove,
\par Revived and cheered and blessed by Thee;
\par The God of pardoning love.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Lift up Thy countenance serene,
\par And let Thy happy child
\par Behold, without a cloud between,
\par The Godhead reconciled.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. That all-comprising peace bestow
\par On me, through  grace forgiven;
\par The joys of holiness below,
\par And then the joys of heaven.
\par                              Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

